{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39820","headline":"贺同年第三人刘先辈咸辟命 · 殷文圭","name":"贺同年第三人刘先辈咸辟命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"甲门才子鼎科人，拂地蓝衫榜下新。\n脱俗文章笑鹦鹉，凌云头角压麒麟。\n金壶藉草溪亭晚，玉勒穿花野寺春。\n多媿受恩同阙里，不嫌师僻与颜贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}